{"id":"n55600-2-5","stage":5,"title":"매섭다 · 凛冽","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55600-2-5-1","ko":"이제 봄이 오는지 날씨가 포근해졌어.","zh":"看来春天要来了，天气变得暖和起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봄이","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오는지","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"19","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포근해졌어.","meaning":"温暖；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"포근하다：温暖；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"포근하다","audio":"/audio/3fdaaf49768bc0c4efcd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83344","senseId":"3","lemma":"포근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"某个时间或季节等来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"3fdaaf49768bc0c4","term":"포근하다","zh":"温暖","audio":"/audio/3fdaaf49768bc0c4efcd.mp3","entryId":"83344","definition":"天气无风而暖和。","pronunciation":["포근하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b3f60cd1571c9039da0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55600-2-5-2","ko":"그러게. 엊그제만 해도 날씨가 매서워서 힘들었는데.","zh":"是啊。就在前几天，天气还冷得让人很难受呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엊그제만","meaning":"几天前，前几天","explanation":"엊그제：几天前，前几天；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"엊그제","audio":"/audio/650ca2349df562b7f242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15164","senseId":"1","lemma":"엊그제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"到了一定的时间或时机。","explanation":"하다：到了一定的时间或时机。；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"20","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매서워서","meaning":"凛冽，严酷","explanation":"매섭다：凛冽，严酷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"매섭다","audio":"/audio/202a3d7915cbbcb951dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55600","senseId":"2","lemma":"매섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들었는데.","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"650ca2349df562b7","term":"엊그제","zh":"几天前，前几天","audio":"/audio/650ca2349df562b7f242.mp3","entryId":"15164","definition":"就在几天之前。","pronunciation":["얻끄제"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"到了一定的时间或时机。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"到了一定的时间或时机。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"202a3d7915cbbcb9","term":"매섭다","zh":"凛冽，严酷","audio":"/audio/202a3d7915cbbcb951dd.mp3","entryId":"55600","definition":"寒气或风等非常厉害。","pronunciation":["매섭따"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4be44b43a988233f49e5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.576,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55600","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊。就在前几天，天气还冷得让人很难受呢。","这次我一定要攻克英语会话的！","看来春天要来了，天气变得暖和起来了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊。就在前几天，天气还冷得让人很难受呢。","看来春天要来了，天气变得暖和起来了。","这次我一定要攻克英语会话的！"],"answer":0}]}
